==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|de}} {{term|Seminar|lang=de}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|seminarium|sēminārium|lang=la}}, from {{term|semen|sēmen|seed|lang=la}}. Compare {{term|seminary|lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[class]] held for [[advanced]] [[studies]] in which students meet regularly to discuss [[original]] [[research]], under the [[guidance]] of a [[professor]].
# A [[meeting]] held for the [[exchange]] of useful information by members of a common [[business]] [[community]].

====Derived terms====
* [[proseminar]]
* [[webinar]]

====Related terms====
